### Bootstrap replicate (optional manual trigger)
POST http://localhost:4120/pipeline/Pipelines(name='ReplicatedCustomers')/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "full"
}

### OData sanity — delegated Customers
GET http://localhost:4120/odata/v4/federation-agent/Customers?$top=3&$select=ID,name

### OData sanity — renamed Products
GET http://localhost:4120/odata/v4/federation-agent/Products?$top=2&$select=productId,productName,unitPrice

### OData sanity — replicated Customers
GET http://localhost:4120/odata/v4/federation-agent/ReplicatedCustomers?$top=3
